[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7800.11, "timestamp": "02:10:00", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7802.55, "timestamp": "02:10:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7805.27, "timestamp": "02:10:05", "text": "一，二。哦，好的。好的。好的。你有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7807.109, "timestamp": "02:10:07", "text": "为了这个，稍微玩一下。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7809.03, "timestamp": "02:10:09", "text": "如果想要更多，就去其他国家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7811.75, "timestamp": "02:10:11", "text": "坦克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7813.03, "timestamp": "02:10:13", "text": "没关系。您可以查看是否还有其他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7816.629, "timestamp": "02:10:16", "text": "我觉得美国有这个国家，你会得到类似这样的结果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7818.98, "timestamp": "02:10:18", "text": "开始时是三个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7829.03, "timestamp": "02:10:29", "text": "这种加速性能就像高级版一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7843.109, "timestamp": "02:10:43", "text": "是的。我们犯了个错误。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7846.069, "timestamp": "02:10:46", "text": "现在，在地面比赛中，不要着急。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7848.229, "timestamp": "02:10:48", "text": "向前。冲刺的感觉非常棒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7849.91, "timestamp": "02:10:49", "text": "往前走，但你会像这样被枪击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7852.629, "timestamp": "02:10:52", "text": "任何事物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7854.47, "timestamp": "02:10:54", "text": "你不能随意射击任何部位"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7857.03, "timestamp": "02:10:57", "text": "坦克，因为它非常，它仍然相当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7858.95, "timestamp": "02:10:58", "text": "就子弹落点而言，这要符合实际情况。"}]